{'symbol': 'HLT', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'HILTON ANNOUNCES OPENING OF CONRAD HANGZHOU TONGLU', 'text': "HILTON ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF CONRAD HANGZHOU TONGLU, A NEW HILLSIDE RESORT WITH 79 SPACIOUS SUITES, INCLUDING 11 VILLAS. THE HOTEL OFFERS A NATURAL HAVEN NESTLED BESIDE THE PICTURESQUE FENSHUI TIANXI LAKE IN TONGLU. GUESTS WILL BE INSPIRED BY THE HOTEL'S EXCEPTIONAL AMENITIES, PREMIER DINING EXPERIENCES AND NATURAL ELEMENTS INCORPORATED INTO ITS DESIGN. THE LATEST ADDITION TO THE CONRAD HOTELS & RESORTS PORTFOLIO, HILTON'S SMART LUXURY BRAND, CONRAD HANGZHOU TONGLU IS OWNED BY CHINA CAPITAL INVESTMENT GROUP AND MANAGED BY HILTON. CONRAD HANGZHOU TONGLU IS LOCATED ALONG THE FAMOUS SCENIC TRAVEL ROUTE THAT ENCOMPASSES WEST LAKE, FUCHUN RIVER AND QIANDAO LAKE. THE NATURE OF TONGLU HAS CAPTIVATED MANY GENERATIONS OF VISITORS WITH THE NATURAL BEAUTY OF TIANXI LAKE, WHERE THEY CAN TAKE RELAXING WALKS OR GO FOR AN EASY JOG ON A WOODEN BOARDWALK ALONG ITS SHORE, OFFERING SOMETHING NEW TO DISCOVER EACH SEASON. THE NEARBY CHAOYANG VILLAGE HAS MANY HISTORIC SIGHTS TO EXPLORE WITH ITS ICONIC GINGKO TREES AND ANCIENT STREETS. THE RESORT IS ACCESSIBLE FROM HANGZHOU XIAOSHAN INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT, LOCATED 150 KILOMETRES AWAY, AND THE TONGLU RAILWAY STATION, WHICH IS 45 KILOMETRES AWAY. IN PURSUIT OF HARMONY BETWEEN NATURE AND ARCHITECTURE, THE HOTEL'S DESIGN DRAWS INSPIRATION FROM THE SURROUNDING MOUNTAINS, LAKES AND PLANTS, WITH ELEMENTS WOVEN SEAMLESSLY INTO THE HOTEL LANDSCAPING AND INTERIOR DESIGN. THE LOCAL GINKGO TREE, FOR INSTANCE, IS REPRESENTED IN THOUGHTFUL DETAILS THROUGHOUT THE RESORT, AND IS USED AS A RECURRING DESIGN MOTIF ON INTERIOR WALLS, FULLY IMMERSING GUESTS IN NATURE AND TRANQUILLITY."}
{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2019-10-17 14:30:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL SEES CONTINUED MARGIN IMPROVEMENT IN AERO UNIT IN 2020 - CONF CALL', 'text': 'HONEYWELL SAYS DOES NOT EXPECT A SIGNIFICANT IMPACT TO THE COMPANY\'S OPERATIONS IN 2019 DUE TO THE GROUNDING OF BOEING\'S 737 MAX JETS.HONEYWELL SAYS IT REMAINS "SOMEWHAT CAUTIOUS" IN ITS OUTLOOK GIVEN THE CONTINUED UNCERTAINTY IN THE MACRO ENVIRONMENT, BUT ADDS THAT FULL YEAR CONTINUES TO BE "SOLIDLY" ON TRACK- CONF CALL.HONEYWELL SAYS IN 2020 GROWTH OUTLOOK FOR THE OVERALL ECONOMY WILL NOT BE AS ROBUST AS IT HAS BEEN IN 2018 AND 2019.HONEYWELL SAYS COMMERCIAL AFTERMARKET ACTIVITY IN 2020 WILL BE DRIVEN BY INCREASES IN FLIGHT HOURS THOUGH AT A SLOWER PACE.HONEYWELL SAYS WILL CONTINUE MARGIN IMPROVEMENT IN 2020 THOUGH LIKELY AT A SLOWER PACE THAN 2019 IN AERO UNIT.HONEYWELL SAYS NONRESIDENTIAL CONSTRUCTION GROWTH WITH SLIGHT MODERATION SHOULD ENABLE CONTINUED DEMAND FOR BUILDING TECHNOLOGIES, PRODUCTS AND SERVICES IN 2020.HONEYWELL SAYS IN PMT UNIT, CO EXPECTS PROCESS AUTOMATION TO CONTINUE TO GROW IN 2020, DUE TO CONTINUED STRONG ORDERS IN BACKLOG.HONEYWELL SAYS IN PMT UNIT, MACRO DATA SUGGESTS THAT THE SOFTER MARKET IN THE U.S. MIDSTREAM OIL AND GAS CONTINUES, WHICH WILL AFFECT THE GAS PROCESSING BUSINESS IN 2020.HONEYWELL SAYS NEGATIVE IMPACT AT ADVANCED MATERIALS FROM ILLEGAL IMPORTS OF HFCS INTO EUROPE WHILE BEING PROACTIVELY ADDRESSED WILL LIKELY CONTINUE INTO 2020.HONEYWELL SAYS IN SPS BUSINESS, PRODUCTIVITY PRODUCTS IS PROGRESSING ON ITS TURNAROUND, AND CO EXPECTS TO RETURN TO GROWTH AND MARGIN EXPANSION DURING 2020.'}
