{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2019-10-17 08:30:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL REPORTS QUARTERLY RESULTS, RAISES 2019 FULL-YEAR EARNINGS AND MARGIN OUTLOOK', 'text': 'HONEYWELL DELIVERS STRONG EARNINGS WITH 370 BASIS POINTS OF OPERATING MARGIN EXPANSION AND 180 BASIS POINTS OF SEGMENT MARGIN EXPANSION; RAISES 2019 FULL-YEAR EARNINGS AND MARGIN GUIDANCE(1).HONEYWELL - RAISES 2019 FULL-YEAR EARNINGS AND MARGIN GUIDANCE.HONEYWELL QTRLY REPORTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $2.23.HONEYWELL - CONTINUE TO DELIVER STRONG RESULTS AND RETURNS FOR OUR SHAREOWNERS, EVEN WITH ONGOING UNCERTAINTY IN MACROECONOMIC ENVIRONMENT.HONEYWELL - QTRLY SALES $ 9,086 MILLION VERSUS $10,762 MILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.HONEYWELL - QTRLY SEGMENT MARGIN 21.2% VERSUS 19.4% REPORTED LAST YEAR.HONEYWELL QTRLY ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $2.08.HONEYWELL - REMAIN ON TRACK TO MEET OUR CASH FLOW COMMITMENTS FOR YEAR.HONEYWELL - QTRLY ORGANIC SALES UP 3%.HONEYWELL - NOW SEES FY SEGMENT MARGIN 20.9% - 21.0%.HONEYWELL - QTRLY AEROSPACE SEGMENT SALES $3,544 MILLION, DOWN 12%.HONEYWELL SEES FY SALES $36.7 BILLION - $36.9 BILLION.HONEYWELL SEES FY ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $8.10 - $8.15.HONEYWELL - QTRLY HONEYWELL BUILDING TECHNOLOGIES SEGMENT SALES $1,415 MILLION, DOWN 44%.HONEYWELL SEES FY ORGANIC SALES GROWTH 4% - 5%.FY2019 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $8.09, REVENUE VIEW $36.94 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.01, REVENUE VIEW $9.11 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}
