{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO SIGNS RENEWABLE ENERGY AGREEMENT WITH NRG ENERGY', 'text': "NRG ENERGY WILL SUPPLY NEARLY 62,000MWH OF CLEAN SOLAR ENERGY TO WELLS FARGO'S 400 LOCATIONS ACROSS TEXAS ANNUALLY FROM A NEW UTILITY-SCALE SOLAR FACILITY. THE AGREEMENT IS EXPECTED TO FURTHER STRENGTHEN AND SUPPORT WELLS FARGO'S CORPORATE STRATEGY TO MEET ITS ELECTRICITY NEEDS THROUGH RENEWABLE ENERGY SOURCES. TRANSITIONING FROM THE PURCHASE OF RENEWABLE ENERGY CERTIFICATES TO LONG-TERM CONTRACTS THAT FUND NEW SOURCES OF RENEWABLE ENERGY IS A CRITICAL PIECE OF WELLS FARGO'S 2020 RENEWABLE ENERGY GOAL. ADDITIONALLY, THE AGREEMENT IS EXPECTED TO MINIMISE WELLS FARGO'S OVERALL CARBON EMISSIONS AND SUPPORT RESILIENCY EFFORTS. THE COMPANY IS ALSO PLANNING TO EXECUTE SUCH AGREEMENTS ACROSS THE US AS PART OF ITS LONG-TERM ENERGY STRATEGY. TO ACHIEVE ITS 2020 RENEWABLE ENERGY GOAL, THE BANK IS ALSO PLANNING TO FURTHER INCREASE ITS ON-SITE SOLAR INSTALLATIONS AT MORE THAN 100 CORPORATE, BRANCH, AND DATA FACILITIES IN THE US."}
{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2019-10-17 11:30:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO ENTERS ITS LARGEST RENEWABLE ENERGY PURCHASE', 'text': 'WELLS FARGO ENTERS ITS LARGEST RENEWABLE ENERGY PURCHASE.WELLS FARGO & CO - ANNOUNCED A 10-YEAR STRUCTURED RENEWABLE ENERGY AGREEMENT WITH RELIANT, AN NRG ENERGY COMPANY.WELLS FARGO & CO - NEW AGREEMENT WILL PROVIDE APPROXIMATELY 62,000 MW-HOURS OF SOLAR ENERGY ANNUALLY TO APPROXIMATELY 400 WELLS FARGO PROPERTIES.WELLS FARGO - WILL EXPAND ITS ON-SITE RENEWABLES PORTFOLIO BY INSTALLING SOLAR TECHNOLOGIES ON OVER 100 CORPORATE, BRANCH, DATA FACILITIES ACROSS U.S..'}
